+// TestSmithersValueClauseNarrowingReachesStatements proves the per-clause
+// FlowSwitchClause narrows the whole clause BODY and not merely its final
+// expression. The statements are bound before the value from the same
+// pre-clause flow, so a binding declared in a clause sees the narrowed
+// scrutinee; getting the order wrong is silent in the permissive direction.
+func TestSmithersValueClauseNarrowingReachesStatements(t *testing.T) {
